{"id":67372,"date":"2025-10-08T07:59:18","date_gmt":"2025-10-08T06:59:18","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67372"},"modified":"2026-10-23T15:40:52","modified_gmt":"2026-10-23T14:40:52","slug":"trail-cabeca-aldeia-natal","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-cabeca-aldeia-natal\/","title":{"rendered":"7\u00ba Trail Cabe\u00e7a Aldeia Natal 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">7\u00ba Trail Cabe\u00e7a Aldeia Natal 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>7\u00ba Trail Cabe\u00e7a Aldeia Natal 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>27 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (domingo), com partida agendada para as <strong>10:00<\/strong> no <strong>Centro da Aldeia de Cabe\u00e7a<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Seia<\/strong> (distrito da <strong>Guarda<\/strong>). Na sua s\u00e9tima edi\u00e7\u00e3o, esta prova de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail-running\/\">trail running<\/a> desafia at\u00e9 300 atletas num percurso \u00fanico de <strong>15 km<\/strong> com tempo limite de <strong>3h30<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O tra\u00e7ado desenvolve-se pelas encostas da <strong>Serra da Estrela<\/strong>, combinando terreno rochoso, passagens por riachos e trilhos florestais em redor de <strong>Cabe\u00e7a<\/strong>, a pitoresca aldeia de xisto reconhecida como a mais ecol\u00f3gica Aldeia Natal de Portugal. Para al\u00e9m de promover o patrim\u00f3nio arquitet\u00f3nico, hist\u00f3rico e ambiental da regi\u00e3o de <strong>Seia<\/strong>, o evento assume uma forte miss\u00e3o ecol\u00f3gica: todas as receitas revertem diretamente para a limpeza de caminhos, ordenamento dos baldios e planta\u00e7\u00e3o de \u00e1rvores aut\u00f3ctones.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada conjuntamente pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Compartes da Aldeia de Cabe\u00e7a<\/strong> e pelo <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Seia<\/strong>, a prova inclui almo\u00e7o opcional para os atletas que o selecionarem, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, pr\u00e9mio finisher, cronometragem por chip e transporte gratuito para duche. Prepara a tua gest\u00e3o de esfor\u00e7o na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\">calculadora de ritmo (pace)<\/a> e descobre mais eventos de montanha no <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calendario-de-corridas\/\">calend\u00e1rio de corridas em Portugal<\/a>. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">27 de Dezembro de 2026 \u00e0s 10:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Centro da Aldeia de Cabe\u00e7a, Seia, Guarda<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Trail \u00danico de 15 km<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Compartes da Aldeia de Cabe\u00e7a e Munic\u00edpio de Seia<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">3h30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/assets.acorrer.pt\/media\/9945\/6aa3d452ce883_Regulamento.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Curto<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail 15 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 27 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Pre\u00e7o \u00danico (at\u00e9 21\/12):<\/strong> 15.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 21\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data, hora e local de partida do 7\u00ba Trail Cabe\u00e7a Aldeia Natal 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O 7\u00ba Trail Cabe\u00e7a Aldeia Natal 2026 realiza-se no domingo, dia 27 de dezembro de 2026, com partida oficial \u00e0s 10:00 no Centro da Aldeia de Cabe\u00e7a, concelho de Seia, distrito da Guarda.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia, idade m\u00ednima e tempo limite da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 constitu\u00eddo por um percurso \u00fanico de Trail Curto com aproximadamente 15 km pelas encostas da Serra da Estrela. A participa\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 aberta a atletas com idade igual ou superior a 18 anos e o tempo m\u00e1ximo de realiza\u00e7\u00e3o (cut-off) \u00e9 de 3h30.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o pre\u00e7o de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo no kit de atleta?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o tem um valor \u00fanico de 15,00 \u20ac (com pagamentos at\u00e9 21 de dezembro de 2026 e limite de 300 vagas) e inclui saco com dorsal e chip RFID, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, seguro desportivo, pr\u00e9mio finisher, transporte gratuito para duche e almo\u00e7o (caso selecionado no ato da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o; acompanhantes pagam 8,00 \u20ac).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o levantamento de dorsais e a entrega de pr\u00e9mios?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os dorsais s\u00e3o entregues mediante apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o do documento de identifica\u00e7\u00e3o e comprovativo de pagamento at\u00e9 60 minutos antes do in\u00edcio da prova (at\u00e9 \u00e0s 09:00). A cerim\u00f3nia de entrega de pr\u00e9mios (Geral M\/F, Seniores, M40\/F40, M50\/F50 e equipa mais numerosa) realiza-se \u00e0s 14:00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade organizadora do 7\u00ba Trail Cabe\u00e7a Aldeia Natal 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Compartes da Aldeia de Cabe\u00e7a e pelo Munic\u00edpio de Seia, revertendo as receitas para a limpeza de caminhos e planta\u00e7\u00e3o de \u00e1rvores aut\u00f3ctones nos baldios locais.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"7\u00ba Trail Cabe\u00e7a Aldeia Natal 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-27\", \"endDate\": \"2026-12-27\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Centro da Aldeia de Cabe\u00e7a\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Seia\", \"addressRegion\": \"Guarda\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O 7\u00ba Trail Cabe\u00e7a Aldeia Natal 2026 realiza-se a 27 de dezembro em Cabe\u00e7a, Seia. Prova de trail de 15 km na Serra da Estrela. Consulta regulamento e inscri\u00e7\u00e3o!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-trail-cabeca-aldeia-natal.webp\"], \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail 15 km\", \"price\": \"15.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/acorrer.pt\/eventos\/7o-trail-cabeca-aldeia-natal\"}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Compartes da Aldeia de Cabe\u00e7a e Munic\u00edpio de Seia\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data, hora e local de partida do 7\u00ba Trail Cabe\u00e7a Aldeia Natal 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O 7\u00ba Trail Cabe\u00e7a Aldeia Natal 2026 realiza-se no domingo, dia 27 de dezembro de 2026, com partida oficial \u00e0s 10:00 no Centro da Aldeia de Cabe\u00e7a, concelho de Seia, distrito da Guarda.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia, idade m\u00ednima e tempo limite da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento \u00e9 constitu\u00eddo por um percurso \u00fanico de Trail Curto com aproximadamente 15 km pelas encostas da Serra da Estrela. A participa\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 aberta a atletas com idade igual ou superior a 18 anos e o tempo m\u00e1ximo de realiza\u00e7\u00e3o (cut-off) \u00e9 de 3h30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o pre\u00e7o de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo no kit de atleta?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o tem um valor \u00fanico de 15,00 \u20ac (com pagamentos at\u00e9 21 de dezembro de 2026 e limite de 300 vagas) e inclui saco com dorsal e chip RFID, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, seguro desportivo, pr\u00e9mio finisher, transporte gratuito para duche e almo\u00e7o (caso selecionado no ato da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o; acompanhantes pagam 8,00 \u20ac).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona o levantamento de dorsais e a entrega de pr\u00e9mios?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os dorsais s\u00e3o entregues mediante apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o do documento de identifica\u00e7\u00e3o e comprovativo de pagamento at\u00e9 60 minutos antes do in\u00edcio da prova (at\u00e9 \u00e0s 09:00). A cerim\u00f3nia de entrega de pr\u00e9mios (Geral M\/F, Seniores, M40\/F40, M50\/F50 e equipa mais numerosa) realiza-se \u00e0s 14:00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem \u00e9 a entidade organizadora do 7\u00ba Trail Cabe\u00e7a Aldeia Natal 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova \u00e9 organizada pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Compartes da Aldeia de Cabe\u00e7a e pelo Munic\u00edpio de Seia, revertendo as receitas para a limpeza de caminhos e planta\u00e7\u00e3o de \u00e1rvores aut\u00f3ctones nos baldios locais.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70433,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[22,497],"event_type_2":[212,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[811],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-67372","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-seia-guarda","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type_2-guarda","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_4-solidaria-sim"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-trail-cabeca-aldeia-natal.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/67372","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=67372"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/